<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Bridging the Capability Gap</span>: Harmonizing Multi-Agent Systems 
<br class="ltx_break">via Joint Alignment Tuning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
