<span id="A1.T7.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt to generate subgoal sequences</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
