<span id="A1.T9.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">If the actions can reached a final answer, you should directly output "Final answer reached". Otherwise, you should give corrections to the original subgoals and their corresponding actions. It is not necessary to be similar to the original subgoals and actions.</span>
</span></td></tr>
